<article class="wrapper wide slide-in">
  <h2>About Wally</h2>
</article>

<article class="wrapper wide slide-in">
  <h3>What is Wally?</h3>
  <p>
    Wally is a digital wallet app for iPhone and iPad. Wally can store all your bank & loyalty cards, identifications, passports, receipts, notes, etc. and keep them safe with Face ID.
  </p>
</article>

<article class="wrapper wide slide-in">
  <h3>How Does it Work?</h3>
  <p>
    Wally is very easy to use. Just take a picture of the front and back of anything you want to add to your wallet, and Wally will add it to your wallet and protect it.
  </p>
</article>

<article class="wrapper wide slide-in">
  <h3>Biometric Authentication</h3>
  <p>
    Wally protects your items with biometric authentication (Face ID & TouchID), and requires that you authenticate yourself before you can open the app.
  </p>
</article>

<article class="wrapper wide slide-in">
  <h3>Look & Feel</h3>
  <p>
    Wally looks and feels just like a real wallet, and can be styled with custom skins and fonts.
  </p>
</article>